<section id="services"><h2>What can Vixera Labs build?</h2>
<div class="profile"><h3>AI automation</h3><p>Use AI to interpret inputs such as inbound emails or supporting documents. For example, a workflow can extract information from a request and send ambiguous cases to a reviewer.</p><p class="fit"><strong>Best suited to</strong> teams with high volumes of varied inputs and a repeatable review process.</p></div>
<div class="profile"><h3>Business process automation</h3><p>Connect steps across an existing SOP, from intake through follow-ups, assignments, approvals, and reporting. A workflow can use rules for routing and AI for steps that require interpretation.</p><p class="fit"><strong>Best suited to</strong> teams moving the same records between tools or chasing the same approvals each week.</p></div>
<div class="profile"><h3>AI integration</h3><p>Bring AI into an existing CRM or internal tool. For example, staff could review drafted updates in their normal workflow before records are written back.</p><p class="fit"><strong>Best suited to</strong> teams that want new capabilities inside the systems they already use.</p></div>
<div class="profile"><h3>AI products and MVPs</h3><p>Build a standalone product or a first version that users can try. Define the core task and acceptance criteria before expanding the feature set.</p><p class="fit"><strong>Best suited to</strong> founders or product teams validating a new AI capability with real users.</p></div>
